  description: "When this card is activated: Banish 1 Ritual Monster from your Deck.
    You can send this card to the GY, then activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF
    Tribute 1 monster from your hand or field, or shuffle 1 Ritual Monster from your
    GY into the Deck, whose Level equals or exceeds the Level of the monster banished
    by this card's effect, then Ritual Summon that monster.\r\n\u25CF Add the monster
    banished by this card's effect to your hand.\r\nYou can only use 1 \"Renewal
    of the World\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."
